{"id":"n66318-1-21","stage":0,"title":"비싸다 · 贵","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66318-1-21-1","ko":"이 가게는 좀 비싼 것 같아.","zh":"这家店看起来有点贵啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가게는","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비싼","meaning":"贵","explanation":"비싸다：贵；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"1","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"063c1a7bb93233dc","term":"비싸다","zh":"贵","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3","entryId":"66318","definition":"物品的价格或做某事所花的费用高于一般水平。","pronunciation":["비싸다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a7a67e3d4186347409f3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66318-1-21-2","ko":"좀 더 싼 곳을 찾아볼까?","zh":"我们要不要找找更便宜的地方？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싼","meaning":"便宜，贱","explanation":"싸다：便宜，贱；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29718","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳을","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾아볼까?","meaning":"取回，找回；试，试图","explanation":"찾다：取回，找回；보다：试，试图；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"},{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"4","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"b291179e0fe019b6","term":"싸다","zh":"便宜，贱","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3","entryId":"29718","definition":"价格低于一般价位。","pronunciation":["싸다"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"取回，找回","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"曾经失去、被夺走、寄存的或借出的东西再次收回。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试，试图","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示试着做前面所指的行为。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea8c99321476c80def76.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66318","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":29,"sequenceScore":1.2753,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这家店看起来有点贵啊。","我们要不要找找更便宜的地方？","最近过得怎么样？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这家店看起来有点贵啊。","我们要不要找找更便宜的地方？","最近过得怎么样？"],"answer":1}]}
